@Evaluacion1_LoretoPradel_HostAddress = https://localhost:44302

### 1. Login: genera un token JWT nuevo (dura 1 hora)
POST {{Evaluacion1_LoretoPradel_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 2. Listar reservas con token (debe dar 200)
GET {{Evaluacion1_LoretoPradel_HostAddress}}/api/Reservas
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### 3. Conectarse al Hub sin token (debe dar 401)
POST {{Evaluacion1_LoretoPradel_HostAddress}}/reservashub/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1